\newlabel{fig: nr_results}{{6}{18}{Comparison for 8D Nonlinear Rastrigin. Left: Potential energy distribution $P(U)$ comparison between PT and Jeffreys Flow. Right: 1D marginal distribution $p(x_1)$ comparison. Both methods show consistent mode coverage and energy profiles}{figure.6}{}}
